## Normative modeling of brain morphometry in self-limited epilepsy with centrotemporal spikes

![Image](./Yang2025_artifacts/image_000001_66994aaa2820fd30e16e1dc57e4eaf26f71746b2d703b11799dc23cdc4c38d0e.png)

Siqi Yang 1, * , Wei Liao 2 , Yimin Zhou 1 , Chengzong Peng 1 , Juan Wang 1 , and Zhiqiang Zhang 3, *

- 1 School of Cybersecurity (Xin Gu Industrial College), Chengdu University of Information Technology, No. 24, Section 1, Xuefu Road, Chengdu Southwest Airport Economic Development Zone, Chengdu 610225, P.R. China

2 The Clinical Hospital of Chengdu Brain Science Institute, School of Life Science and Technology, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, No. 2006, Xiyuan Avenue, High-tech West District, Chengdu, Chengdu 610054, P.R. China

